WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.640
Ever feel like a small fish in a crowded pond?

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:05.440
You're posting more.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.720
And so is everyone else.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.880
Clipping changes the way we share content.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.400
One long video, 30 clips,

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.280
and more chances to get discovered.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.320
But building a brand takes more than clips.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.900
Whether you're a founder, a thought leader,

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.440
or a marketing team,

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.480
you need different formats and consistent quality

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.400
to keep your viewers watching.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.640
Take this 15-minute podcast I just recorded.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.600
Yeah, it's pretty rough,

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.200
but OpusClip 4.0 can handle the edits for me.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.200
I'm our CEO here at OpusClip.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.120
We're turning your raw footage...

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.360
But that video alone is not enough to perform.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.680
I need more short-form videos to engage more viewers,

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.400
with engaging hooks,

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.120
and of course, in my brand style.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.600
For spontaneous moments, I upload my footage

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.000
and choose different styles.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.300
Now here's the good part.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.000
I saved those settings.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.200
Next time, I add my footage,

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.000
pick my saved recipe,

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.000
and the edits run automatically.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.080
Then I review and schedule my videos inside OpusClip.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.300
Over 20 million users and brands

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.840
have created more than 1 billion social clips.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.600
Now, it's your turn to become a content powerhouse.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:24.800
OpusClip.
